      "value": "Experiencing the same issues.\n\nI can get 3 gestures working at a time, but there's no way to create enough combinations to get them all back because for some reason in the \"chords\" setup, one \"chord\" will randomly override another. And without the ability to assign dead zones there won't be enough independent combinations to restore Reverb G2 controllers gestures back to what it was before the update.",
