      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same issue here:\n\n- Thumb button has been inverted ( now push to \"thumb in\" rather than previous \"push to thumb out\")\n\n- Default now \"open hands\", previously resting hands (and squeeze-let-go grip+trigger to lock \"open hands\")\n\n- gestures such as \"Peace\" and \"Rock&Roll\" no longer work, legacy fingers or not\n\n- interestingly, releasing grip while holding down trigger and thumb does nothing, remaining as a fist. I would assume it is supposed to form an \"Ok\" gesture.\n\nThis is hits extra hard on sign-language users, about half our hand gestures are gone. Please fix ASAP",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
