  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since the new patch introduced finger tracking through SteamVR skeletal systems, gestures and expressions have been irreparably broken.\n\nSteamVR uses the Microsoft Recommended Bindings for VRChat and these bindings use the control stick dead zones along with button combinations to emulate gestures. This no longer works with the new build and has left HP Reverb G2 users crippled for the time being. Attempting to map new custom bindings and disable/enable skeletal systems in the control scheme have all been fruitless.\n\nNot sure how many others have reported this to the feedback site, but there's been whisperings of it on other sites such as YouTube and Reddit.\n\nPlease fix",
